      en: ["Lausanne has served as the headquarters of the International Olympic Committee since 1915.", "The Olympic Museum was opened in 1993 and is the largest of its kind in the world.", "Construction of the Cathedral of Notre-Dame began around 1170 and concluded in 1275.", "The M2 metro line is the world's steepest driverless subway, ascending 338 vertical meters.", "More than 28 international sports federations are headquartered in the city.", "The city is home to the EPFL, one of the world's leading technical universities."],
